      "text": "Price Tracking Service (WebCrawler)",
      "fontSize": 53.45400255445475,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Price Tracking Service (WebCrawler)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mjotw5GE8TVBeEN_ksDQ9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 337,
      "y": 145.5,
      "width": 514.61962890625,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1353356775,
      "version": 453,
      "versionNonce": 673826439,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786326165441,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n1) able to view price history for all Amazon products\n2) Subscribe to price drops based on price threshold\n\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1) availability >> consistency\n2) scale to 500M amazon products\n3) low latency price history queries (<500ms)\n4) Timely price drop notification (<1h from change)\n\n\nCore Entities\n- Product\n- User\n- Subscription\n- Price",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n1) able to view price history for all Amazon products\n2) Subscribe to price drops based on price threshold\n\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1) availability >> consistency\n2) scale to 500M amazon products\n3) low latency price history queries (<500ms)\n4) Timely price drop notification (<1h from change)\n\n\nCore Entities\n- Product\n- User\n- Subscription\n- Price",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0jQT9-LdxsvAJOrbnfiwe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 339,
      "y": 611.5,
      "width": 806.8392944335938,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1838842665,
      "version": 10,
      "versionNonce": 129969577,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786326175861,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API\n\n// Retrieve historical price data for charts and displays\nGET /products/{product_id}/price?period=30d&granularity=daily -> PriceHistory[]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API\n\n// Retrieve historical price data for charts and displays\nGET /products/{product_id}/price?period=30d&granularity=daily -> PriceHistory[]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WPsApQPzIkXKtaMuqBHf_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 731.5,
      "width": 533.57958984375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 416793161,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 98599945,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786326184092,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// Subscribe to price drop notifications with threshold\nPOST /subscriptions\n{\n  product_id,\n  price_threshold,\n  notification_type,\n}\n-> 200",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// Subscribe to price drop notifications with threshold\nPOST /subscriptions\n{\n  product_id,\n  price_threshold,\n  notification_type,\n}\n-> 200",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
